    opponent controls up to the number of different Attributes among the monsters
    on the field. You can only use this effect of "Elemental HERO Shining Neos Wingman"
    once per turn. If this card destroys a monster by battle: Inflict damage to your
    opponent equal to that monster''s original ATK.'
